{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6BE76014","title":"Samuel Jaynes First meeting","entry":"Dlg_6BE76014::entry","exit":"Dlg_6BE76014::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_4C95FEEB","articyId":"72057615512784613","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Care to hear the voice of the true Gods?","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Care to hear the voice of the true Gods?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":450.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47272","byteOffset":32219504,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_AA9DB34A","articyId":"72057615512784635","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Given time, I believe we can all reunite with our bicameral selves. From there, the voices will return.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Given time, I believe we can all reunite with our bicameral selves. From there, the voices will return.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29797","byteOffset":19153784,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_FC5498E7","articyId":"72057615512784649","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"The True Gods! The gods only revealed to us when we return to our true bicameral mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The True Gods! The gods only revealed to us when we return to our true bicameral mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20985","byteOffset":15821176,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_0A4DF07D","articyId":"72057615512784663","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"It is as if life evolved to a certain point and then in ourselves turned at a right angle and simply exploded in another direction.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It is as if life evolved to a certain point and then in ourselves turned at a right angle and simply exploded in another direction.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25192","byteOffset":17412264,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_49912037","articyId":"72057615512784677","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Have you ever wondered where our consciousness comes from?","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Have you ever wondered where our consciousness comes from?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39513","byteOffset":29277984,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_D77A0DC4","articyId":"72057615512784698","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Well, it is my belief that one half of our brain 'does', because the other half 'tells', and the voice that does the telling belongs not to us, but to the true gods.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, it is my belief that one half of our brain 'does', because the other half 'tells', and the voice that does the telling belongs not to us, but to the true gods.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4050.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39014","byteOffset":29091088,"byteLength":548}},{"id":"DFr_0932D6E7","articyId":"72057615512784704","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Over millennia, we have convinced ourselves that our brains are one, belonging entirely to ourselves, but if we learn to listen, we will learn to hear.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Over millennia, we have convinced ourselves that our brains are one, belonging entirely to ourselves, but if we learn to listen, we will learn to hear.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39165","byteOffset":29148704,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_B3DAAD83","articyId":"72057615512784735","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"You speak only of mortal voices. Even those made digital and synthetic pale in the shadow of the True Gods.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You speak only of mortal voices. Even those made digital and synthetic pale in the shadow of the True Gods.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24658","byteOffset":17205728,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_CD7D2684","articyId":"72057615512784757","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"The voices of those so ancient and internal that we have all but tuned out their frequency. When we recover our bicameral mind, we recover words of our makers.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The voices of those so ancient and internal that we have all but tuned out their frequency. When we recover our bicameral mind, we recover words of our makers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40718","byteOffset":29731976,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_FCBC56FF","articyId":"72057615512784764","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"I expect it does to ears attached to a non-bicameral mind.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I expect it does to ears attached to a non-bicameral mind.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17033","byteOffset":14334104,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_79180814","articyId":"72057615512784780","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"I believe that our path through life is a collaboration with those who know us best and that if we are willing to listen, we are joined on our journey, not forced along it.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I believe that our path through life is a collaboration with those who know us best and that if we are willing to listen, we are joined on our journey, not forced along it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45062","byteOffset":31380912,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_40AD25F2","articyId":"72057615512784795","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Now open your mind in all directions... Reach out... Reach out... Reach out... Can you hear them?","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Now open your mind in all directions... Reach out... Reach out... Reach out... Can you hear them?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5550.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35101","byteOffset":25639968,"byteLength":480}},{"id":"DFr_6EFAC757","articyId":"72057615512784816","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Ugh... then, perhaps you are more ready than most to share your path. Return to me when you'd like to explore your insides more comprehensively.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ugh... then, perhaps you are more ready than most to share your path. Return to me when you'd like to explore your insides more comprehensively.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":6450.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48593","byteOffset":32719408,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_7A29DCAB","articyId":"72057615512784823","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Locating the true voice can take time. Return to me when you'd like to explore your insides more comprehensively.","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Locating the true voice can take time. Return to me when you'd like to explore your insides more comprehensively.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6450.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37258","byteOffset":28436696,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_296C484B","articyId":"72057821671326415","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Samuel Jaynes","text":"Take a moment with me now.... Allow your breathing to sync with the city... Allow written language to seep from your skin and feel that weight as it becomes a part of the world around you...","speakerId":"Ntt_43395A00","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Take a moment with me now.... Allow your breathing to sync with the city... Allow written language to seep from your skin and feel that weight as it becomes a part of the world around you...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33818","byteOffset":20676176,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_00F7829C","articyId":"72057615512784619","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"True Gods?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"True Gods?","TextSheVersion":"True Gods?","TextTheyVersion":"True Gods?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44399","byteOffset":31127872,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_39B8A3D3","articyId":"72057615512784627","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No thank you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No thank you.","TextSheVersion":"No thank you.","TextTheyVersion":"No thank you."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39583","byteOffset":29304352,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_ECD45813","articyId":"72057615512784642","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What voices?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What voices?","TextSheVersion":"What voices?","TextTheyVersion":"What voices?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49595","byteOffset":33104960,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_06C1246E","articyId":"72057615512784656","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"A bicameral mind?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A bicameral mind?","TextSheVersion":"A bicameral mind?","TextTheyVersion":"A bicameral mind?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2550.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39215","byteOffset":29167704,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_20FCEDD1","articyId":"72057615512784670","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Which direction were we going before?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Which direction were we going before?","TextSheVersion":"Which direction were we going before?","TextTheyVersion":"Which direction were we going before?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35391","byteOffset":25749552,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_1D6E10CA","articyId":"72057615512784684","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I've thought about it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I've thought about it.","TextSheVersion":"I've thought about it.","TextTheyVersion":"I've thought about it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41096","byteOffset":29876240,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_787CEC69","articyId":"72057615512784690","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Nope.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Nope.","TextSheVersion":"Nope.","TextTheyVersion":"Nope."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3750.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22551","byteOffset":16418456,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_C938E464","articyId":"72057615512784712","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not convinced.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not convinced.","TextSheVersion":"I'm not convinced.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not convinced."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18596","byteOffset":14922080,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_9CC78990","articyId":"72057615512784718","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Interesting...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Interesting...","TextSheVersion":"Interesting...","TextTheyVersion":"Interesting..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40606","byteOffset":29690512,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_74CCBF24","articyId":"72057615512784728","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm not sure I need to hear MORE voices...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not sure I need to hear MORE voices...","TextSheVersion":"I'm not sure I need to hear MORE voices...","TextTheyVersion":"I'm not sure I need to hear MORE voices..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36096","byteOffset":28002952,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_5AB0E56F","articyId":"72057615512784742","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"True Gods? Sounds interesting.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"True Gods? Sounds interesting.","TextSheVersion":"True Gods? Sounds interesting.","TextTheyVersion":"True Gods? Sounds interesting."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46222","byteOffset":31817408,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_5C4A7200","articyId":"72057615512784748","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"This sounds nonsensical.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"This sounds nonsensical.","TextSheVersion":"This sounds nonsensical.","TextTheyVersion":"This sounds nonsensical."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48386","byteOffset":32640864,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_10DCE532","articyId":"72057615512784773","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You don't believe in freewill?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't believe in freewill?","TextSheVersion":"You don't believe in freewill?","TextTheyVersion":"You don't believe in freewill?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4350.0,"y":825.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35776","byteOffset":27881992,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_73010860","articyId":"72057615512784787","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How do we hear these voices?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How do we hear these voices?","TextSheVersion":"How do we hear these voices?","TextTheyVersion":"How do we hear these voices?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4950.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36539","byteOffset":28168296,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_973C2C14","articyId":"72057615512784802","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"(Lie) Yes, I hear distant murmur.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"(Lie) Yes, I hear distant murmur.","TextSheVersion":"(Lie) Yes, I hear distant murmur.","TextTheyVersion":"(Lie) Yes, I hear distant murmur."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5850.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52243","byteOffset":34178568,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_745D0D9C","articyId":"72057615512784809","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I hear nothing.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hear nothing.","TextSheVersion":"I hear nothing.","TextTheyVersion":"I hear nothing."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":5850.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21469","byteOffset":16009584,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_D800640A","articyId":"72057615512784832","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Ok, that didn't answer my question.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ok, that didn't answer my question.","TextSheVersion":"Ok, that didn't answer my question.","TextTheyVersion":"Ok, that didn't answer my question."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3150.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20464","byteOffset":15624896,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_4169037C","articyId":"72057834556102513",